    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19992" root="سفك" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَفَّاكٌ</span></b>  One <i>who sheds</i> blood, and tears, <i>much;</i>
(Msb;) [as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَفُوكٌ</span></b> .] You say <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَفَّاكٌ لِلدِّمَآءِ</span>
<i>A great shedder of blood.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And (assumed tropical:)  <i>Eloquent;</i> (Kr, K;) <i>an able speaker.</i> (S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3- 
And (tropical:)  <i>Mendacious; a great,</i> or <i>habitual, liar;</i>
(TA;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَفُوكٌ</span></b> , (K,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَفُوكٌ بَالكَلَامِ</span>
(TA.)

